  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 900 INSPECTION AND ENFORCEMENT",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Hw 900 INSPECTION AND ENFORCEMENT\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 147-A:3; RSA 147-A:7\n\nREVISION NOTE #1:\n\nDocument #9367, effective 1-28-09, readopted with amendments and redesignated the former Chapter Env-Wm 900 as Env-Hw 900. The redesignation from subtitle Env-Wm to Env-Hw was done pursuant to a rules reorganization plan for Department rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on 9-7-05. Document #9367 replaces all prior filings for hazardous waste rules formerly in Chapter Env-Wm 900. The numerals of the rules remained unchanged, and the source note information for the rules under Document #9367 refer to those same numbers under the subtitle Env-Wm.\n\nREVISION NOTE #2:\n\nDocument #13784, effective 10-21-23, adopted Part Env-Hw 904 titled “Fines Relating to Hazardous Waste Management.” But Part Env-Hw 904 was originally adopted as Env-C 612 in Document #7204, effective 2-24-00, and was titled “Fines Relating to Hazardous and Solid Waste Management.” Part Env-Hw 612 was readopted as an interim rule in Document #9093, effective 2-24-08, and expired 8-22-08.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw900.html"
